<p>Michael Mills<br>+1 (207) 712-7052 | mmills6060@gmail.com | New York, NY<br>linkedin.com/in/michael-a-mills/ | github.com/mmills60601</p>
<p>January 26, 2026</p>
<p>Dear Hiring Manager,</p>
<p>I am writing to express my strong interest in the AI &amp; Machine Learning Engineering Consultant - Senior position at EY. With several years of experience in software engineering, machine learning, and client-facing roles, I am excited about the opportunity to join your dynamic team of scientists and engineers who tackle the most challenging computational problems for clients across diverse industries.</p>
<p>This role immediately caught my attention because it perfectly aligns with my passion for researching, building, and implementing scalable AI systems that drive measurable business impact. I am particularly drawn to EY&#39;s focus on delivering innovative AI solutions that unify, enrich, and derive insights from varied data sources across broad technology landscapes. My proven track record of designing and maintaining high-impact, production-grade AI/ML solutions on major cloud platforms, combined with my experience in client-facing consulting environments, positions me well to contribute immediately to your team&#39;s success.</p>
<p>What excites me most about this opportunity is the chance to work side-by-side with clients to navigate the complex world of modern data science, analytics, and software engineering. My technical expertise spans the full AI/ML lifecycle - from enhancing data pipelines for optimal accuracy and cleanliness to monitoring and optimizing learning processes for high-performance models. I have extensive experience with Generative AI models and frameworks including OpenAI, LangChain, and Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG), as well as deep proficiency in ML packages like scikit-learn and PyTorch. Additionally, my strong foundation in DevOps tools (Git, Azure DevOps), Agile methodologies, and CI/CD pipelines enables me to develop, deploy, and scale analytical solutions effectively.</p>
<p>I am particularly well-suited for EY&#39;s collaborative, interdisciplinary approach. My experience working with diverse, hybrid, and global teams has honed my ability to communicate complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and business stakeholders. I understand that no two days will be the same in this role, and I thrive in fast-paced environments that require continuous learning and staying ahead of emerging trends. My willingness to travel for client engagements and my track record of building and maintaining strong client relationships align perfectly with EY&#39;s client-centric culture.</p>
<p>The opportunity to help clients revolutionize how they leverage artificial intelligence while contributing to EY&#39;s mission of building a better working world resonates deeply with my professional values. I am eager to bring my technical depth, analytical problem-solving skills, and passion for innovation to your team while continuing to grow as a subject matter expert within your organization.</p>
<p>Thank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in scalable AI systems, client consulting, and collaborative problem-solving can contribute to EY&#39;s continued success in delivering cutting-edge AI solutions.</p>
<p>Sincerely,<br>Michael Mills</p>
